hifiberry-squeezelite (2.0.0.1545) stable; urgency=medium

  * Changed systemd unit to use Restart=on-failure instead of always
  * Added user validation check to start-squeezelite script
  * Only allow running as root or user specified in /etc/hifiberry.user
  * Exit with code 0 to prevent systemd restart attempts on failure
  * Removed empty prerm maintainer script

